<node id="concept_probability_amplitude_interference">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">概率幅叠加与干涉项 — 持仓非线性风险</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_薛定谔方程与持仓波函数_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_费曼物理学讲义卷3_概率幅与双缝_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_费曼量子电动力学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Core concept across 3 quantum mechanics reading notes: portfolio risks superpose via probability amplitudes not classical probabilities; interference term 2Re(psi1*psi2) captures correlation effects missing from additive risk models.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_dissipative_structure_funding">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">耗散结构 — 趋势依赖资金能量输入维持</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_尼科利斯普里戈金探索复杂性_耗散结构_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Prigogine's dissipative structure theory applied to markets: trends require continuous capital inflow (energy) to maintain order; when funding decelerates the structure dissipates. Market order is 'living order' not frozen order.</data>
  <data key="d5">297</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_information_cascade_fragility">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">信息级联与脆弱性 — 社会信息压过私有信息</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_伊斯利克莱因贝格网络众筹与市场_网络行为经济学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Easley &amp; Kleinberg's information cascade model: when social information (others buying) overrides private signals, cascades form with no new information added — structurally fragile and prone to sudden reversal.</data>
  <data key="d5">241</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_holevo_bound_extraction">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">Holevo 界 — 信息提取的绝对上限</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_霍列沃量子系统信道_信息提取上限_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_贝肯斯坦黑洞信息悖论_信息守恒_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Holevo bound from quantum information theory: there is an absolute upper limit on useful information extractable from market data. Beyond this bound, claims are necessarily noise or overfitting. Connected to Bekenstein bound on per-dimension information capacity.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_swarm_intelligence_follow">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">群体智能 — 高多样性时跟随优于分析</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_博纳博群体智能_蚁群算法与简单规则_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_卡马津自组织生物学_局部规则全局模式_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Bonabeau &amp; Camazine: when market participants are diverse and information flows well, the collective intelligence embedded in price action surpasses individual analysis — simple trend following outperforms complex models. When participants homogenize, swarm intelligence degrades to groupthink.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_diversity_prediction_theorem">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">多样性预测定理 — 集体误差=平均误差-多样性</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_佩奇多样性与复杂性_群体多样性_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Page's Diversity Prediction Theorem: collective prediction error = average individual error - prediction diversity. A diverse ensemble of mediocre predictors outperforms any single optimized predictor. Free lunch of diversity.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_langton_lambda_regulation">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">λ参数与混沌边缘 — 决策系统的最优信息处理区</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_兰顿人工生命_混沌边缘的计算_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_勒温复杂_混沌边缘的科学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Langton's lambda parameter in cellular automata: a decision system's information processing capacity is maximized at the 'edge of chaos' — not too ordered (rigid) and not too chaotic (random). Measurable via strategy update frequency, decision consistency, position sizing variability.</data>
  <data key="d5">176</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_hawking_radiation_edge_decay">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">Edge 霍金辐射 — 交易优势的不可逆蒸发</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_贝肯斯坦黑洞信息悖论_信息守恒_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_勒温复杂_混沌边缘的科学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Bekenstein-Hawking radiation metaphor: every trading edge decays like a black hole evaporates via Hawking radiation. Large edges (macro logic) evaporate slowly, small edges (micro-arbitrage) evaporate fast. Continuous replacement needed; Lewin's 'moving landscape' provides complementary framework.</data>
  <data key="d5">298</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_measurement_delay_principle">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">延迟测量原则 — 过早检查盈亏破坏认知叠加</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_默明量子计算机科学_逻辑门与运算_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_薛定谔方程与持仓波函数_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Mermin's quantum computing principle applied to trading: measuring P&amp;L too frequently collapses the cognitive superposition state, destroying the quantum advantage of holding multiple scenarios simultaneously. Delay measurement to preset decision points only.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_self_organization_four_features">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">自组织四特征 — 局部规则+正负反馈+涨落容忍</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_卡马津自组织生物学_局部规则全局模式_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_哈肯协同学_自组织同步_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Camazine's four features of self-organization: local interactions (no global blueprint), positive feedback (amplification), negative feedback (stabilization), and fluctuations (randomness enables new structures). A self-organizing trading system needs all four.</data>
  <data key="d5">51</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_order_parameter_slaving">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">序参量役使原理 — 慢变量决定快变量</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_哈肯协同学_自组织同步_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Haken's slaving principle: near phase transitions, slow variables (order parameters) enslave fast variables. Markets: macro trend/capital flow direction (slow) enslaves daily price noise (fast). 80% analysis effort on slow variables, 20% on timing.</data>
  <data key="d16">序参量役使原理——慢变量决定快变量</data>
  <data key="d17">{"source_file": "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_哈肯协同学_自组织同步_交易穿透.md", "trading_application": "80%分析时间花在慢变量(方向/资金/结构)，20%花在快变量(入场时机)", "cross_reference": "Haken/Buchanan/Newman"}</data>
  <data key="d5">22</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_three_degrees_market_sentiment">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">三度影响力与情绪传播 — 市场情绪沿网络传播3-5天衰减</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_克里斯塔基斯富勒连接的纽带_社会网络传播_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Christakis &amp; Fowler's three degrees of influence: market sentiment propagates through information networks — 1st degree (hours-1day), 2nd (1-2days), 3rd (2-4days), then decays. The 'three-degree window' is the effective period for sentiment-driven trend following.</data>
  <data key="d5">241</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_von_neumann_evolution_trilemma">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">策略进化三要素 — 复制+变异+选择</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_冯诺依曼自复制自动机_通用构造_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">von Neumann's self-reproducing automaton framework: a strategy ecosystem evolves through replication (copying successful strategies), variation (parameter perturbation/module recombination), and selection (backtest + small live test). Trader role upgrades from strategy designer to evolution mechanism engineer.</data>
  <data key="d5">298</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_fermi_simplicity_discipline">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">费米简洁原则 — 系统可写进176页或一张A4纸</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_费米热力学与交易系统工具观_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_费曼量子电动力学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Fermi's 176-page Thermodynamics and Feynman's QED with 3 basic actions share the same principle: a complete system can be expressed with minimal components. Trading system rules should fit on one A4 sheet; strategy should decompose into &lt;=5 basic actions (enter/exit/add/reduce/wait).</data>
  <data key="d5">176</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_bifurcation_regime_switch">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">分支点与体制切换 — 缩量低波动后方向选择不可预测</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_尼科利斯普里戈金探索复杂性_耗散结构_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_勒温复杂_混沌边缘的科学_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_卡斯蒂复杂化_不可预测与突现_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Prigogine bifurcation + Lewin phase transition + Casti emergence: market regime switches are abrupt (1-2 days), preceded by narrowing range + shrinking volume + lowered volatility (critical slowing down). Direction selection at bifurcation point is fundamentally unpredictable due to fluctuation amplification.</data>
  <data key="d5">176</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_pheromone_positive_feedback">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">信息素正反馈 — 关注度积累2-6周后自然挥发</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_博纳博群体智能_蚁群算法与简单规则_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_伊斯利克莱因贝格网络众筹与市场_网络行为经济学_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Bonabeau's ant colony pheromone mechanism + Easley &amp; Kleinberg's network effects: profitable strategies attract attention (pheromone), creating positive feedback. Attention naturally volatilizes in 2-6 weeks. Entry when pheromone is accumulating (volume + attention rising together), exit when it peaks.</data>
  <data key="d5">241</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_toolbox_market_regime_mapping">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">工具箱视角 — 多策略应对多市场状态</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_佩奇多样性与复杂性_群体多样性_交易穿透.md", "stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-27_加德纳数学游戏_生命游戏与涌现_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Page's toolbox perspective + Gardner's Game of Life: maintain 3-5 simple strategies each labeled with effective conditions (trend/range/high vol/low vol). Build a market state classifier (using volatility/momentum/volume) to select the right tool. 3-5 simple rules + iteration = emergent adaptability.</data>
  <data key="d5">176</data>
</node>
<node id="concept_holographic_boundary_management">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">全息边界管理 — 少数边界指标投影系统整体状态</data>
  <data key="d2">reading_notes</data>
  <data key="d3">["stock_data/reading_notes/2026-05-26_贝肯斯坦黑洞信息悖论_信息守恒_交易穿透.md"]</data>
  <data key="d4">Bekenstein's holographic principle: a system's full information can be encoded on its boundary. Trading system management should use a few 'boundary metrics' (total PnL, total risk exposure, portfolio correlation structure) rather than tracking every internal detail — equivalent compression without information loss.</data>
  <data key="d5">22</data>
</node>
